  "description": "You want to be flexible and to ride all kinds of roads and trails? The world is your playground and with the MITTE STEEL v3 there are no limits.\n\nEven if you spend many hours in the saddle and ride over gravel, forest paths, tarmac or through mud and slush, the 8bar MITTE STEEL v3 will not let you down! It is a multi-purpose bike that is easy to maintain and a reliable companion.\n\nSTEEL FRAME\n\nSteel is robust, resilient and comfortable. It gives you safety and confidence for your next trip. The perfect frame material to meet the needs of commuters, nature lovers and bike packers. The classic and delicate tube design is timeless. It is both: beautiful and strong.\n\nDISC BRAKES\n\nDisc brakes are the most effective brakes in any terrain. When roads get muddy and dirty your safety is guaranteed.\n\nCAGE MOUNTS\n\nThe multiple cage mounts allow you to add bottles, fenders and bags to your bike. Numerous possibilities to be perfectly equipped for the next tour.\n\nSLIDER DROPOUTS\n\nThanks to our in-house developed slider dropouts, the 8bar MITTE STEEL can be easily converted. The bike's geometry adapts to your individual needs, enabling you to use various types of tires. This system also allows you to ride the 8bar MITTE STEEL as a Singlespeed bike or with an internal gear hub.",
